017100        WHEN 0
017200           CONTINUE
017300        WHEN OTHER
017400           MOVE '2000-OPEN-C-ASSE-ASSI' TO ERR-PARA
017500           PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
017600     END-EVALUATE
017700     PERFORM 2100-FETCH-NEXT THRU 2100-FETCH-NEXT-EXIT
017800     PERFORM 2200-PROCESS-ROW THRU 2200-PROCESS-ROW-EXIT
